11' x 12' space, making it accessible for small rooms or dedicated meditation areas. A built-in meditation timer helps you keep track of your sessions, creating a balanced experience that blends movement, mindfulness, and meditation for overall well-being.", "short_description": "Virtual Tai Chi is an app designed to teach Yang Style Tai Chi, guiding users through fundamental movements and forms. Perfect for all skill levels, it offers an accessible and immersive way to practice Tai Chi at home, enhancing balance, relaxation, and mindfulness."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/virtaichi/home?authuser=2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Vir Tai Chi", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/virtaichi/home?authuser=2", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29390493420566545"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392000_9489749437770358_2425873147646892803_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2d1DVR-hXooQ7kNvwG8F4Gf&_nc_oc=Adn12uTA31Cd1LWc5Z5Z3lGFC3hYMxg4yWpvylJwCW88wq9DF70hD_xqQ6bqwXjAfBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsj58qMKfXxF5SfLE-p8reY-StlX1qJ0tyUaeNXi2JWQg&oe=699AF754"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": fa